sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner as Case Owner
    box Mortuary T responsibility
    participant App as Mortuary T
    participant Record as Compliance record
    end
    box Outside Mortuary T
    participant Share as Device sharing options / selected app
    end
    Note over Owner,Record: Precondition: active Case Ref, authorized Case Owner, editable First Call
    Owner->>App: Enter available First Call details
    App-->>Owner: Display case-linked summary
    opt Correction needed
        Owner->>App: Edit First Call, correct details
        App-->>Owner: Display corrected summary
    end
    Note over Owner,App: Optional recipient entry is for the compliance log only
    Owner->>App: Save & Share First Call Summary
    App-->>Owner: Save First Call & Open Share Options
    alt Cancel confirmation
        Owner->>App: Cancel
        App-->>Owner: Return to summary
        Note over App,Record: No completed save or external handoff
    else Continue confirmation
        Owner->>App: Continue
        App->>Record: Save First Call associated with active Case Ref
        Record-->>App: Save completed (logical result)
        Note over App,Record: Save precedes the external handoff
        App->>Share: Open sharing options with First Call summary
        alt Proceed in selected app
            Owner->>Share: Choose actual recipient, perform send action
            Note over Owner,Share: Sending and delivery are controlled by the selected app
        else Cancel or leave external sharing
            Owner->>Share: Cancel or leave without sending
        end
        Note over Record,Share: Saved record remains in either path
        Owner->>App: Return to Mortuary T
        App-->>Owner: Share Action Completed
        Owner->>App: OK
        Note over App,Share: Handoff status is not delivery confirmation
        App-->>Owner: First Call Needs Review, case Current
        Owner->>App: View in Compliance
        App->>Record: Access saved First Call for matching Case Ref
        Record-->>App: Saved First Call (logical result)
        App-->>Owner: Display saved record for verification
    end
